    "Content": "<p>In late September 2022, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://aka.ms/HSLTRPublicPreview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Retain database backups for longer periods of time with long-term backup retention on Azure SQL Database Hyperscale</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
